AB  - The main purpose of mining and detecting abnormal data is to ensure the safety and stability of computer network operations. Design a new technology that can detect abnormal data in real time and report to the system in time. This technology can detect and report violations in the entire process of computer network operation. Compared with the previous work of detecting abnormal data in the operation of computer networks, data detection and processing methods based on mathematical statistics have the characteristics of high efficiency, strong adaptability and scientificity. Through mathematical calculation method for abnormal data detection and processing, a series of laws between abnormal data can be accurately found. Then, extracting relevant and effective information from it can greatly increase the utilization rate and application value of the data. This paper mainly proposes to apply this method to anomaly detection system from the perspective of mathematical statistics to optimize the abnormal data mining processing model in network operation, thereby improving the accuracy of abnormal data detection.
