AB  - Aiming at the information security problems of intelligent networked vehicles, especially the communication security and application security issues, this paper studies how to identify abnormal behaviors related to security from the massive network data, application data and vehicle bus data generated in real time by machine learning technology, and form the intrusion detection system technology based on neural network. In this paper, the characteristics of the existing data sets are deeply studied, and a variety of new features are proposed based on the domain knowledge of various network attacks in the Internet of vehicles environment, and the standard data set for the network security detection field of the Internet of vehicles environment is constructed. The framework of intrusion detection system based on neural network vehicle bus is studied. Research on machine learning model and model fusion technology suitable for abnormal detection of bus data, Ethernet data and operating system log data, fill in the domestic technical gap, provide strong support for the implementation of active defense, and improve the information security defense level of intelligent networked vehicles.
