AB  - This paper describes a novel approach to traffic analysis in high speed networks based on data mining techniques. Data mining techniques are here applied as a means to effectively process the significant amount of captured data. The paper provides a first evaluation of the proposed approach in terms of its ability of extracting relevant information and its computational requirements. Such evaluation is based on experiments run on a prototypal implementation of the proposed approach.
