AU  - J. Jiao
AU  - F. Du
AU  - X. Yang
AU  - L. Li
T2  - 2022 4th International Conference on Advances in Computer Technology, Information Science and Communications (CTISC)
AB  - The work of Chinese expressway managers has the characteristics of singleness and continuity. The working environment has high requirements for dealing with emergencies, especially for the prediction results of new employees' future work conditions. It has a high reference value for its guidance and career planning. This paper proposes a method based on employee operation log as the main data source. The combination of sliding window and LSTM is adopted. Establish an employee behavior prediction model based on SW-LSTM. The model effectively changes the limitations of personnel management only relying on reports in the past, and improves the behavior granularity and accuracy of management. The system runs in the real environment of a provincial toll station. The prediction algorithm is used to analyze, verify and compare the real results of employee historical data. It is proved that the system has high prediction accuracy and practicability.
