AB  - This chapter focuses on using Amazon Web Services (AWS) services for various cloud threat protection in alignment with MITRE ATT&amp;CK Framework. AWS offers AWS Well&#x2010; Architected Tool, a free service in the cloud that provides a consistent process for to review and measure the architecture using the AWS Well&#x2010;Architected Framework. SQL injection is one of several different types of code injection techniques used to attack data&#x2010;driven applications. Adversaries may use alternate authentication material, such as password hashes, Kerberos tickets, and application access tokens, in order to move laterally within an environment and bypass normal system access controls. The chapter describes an automated response for a simulated event that indicates potential unauthorized activity, the unintended disabling of CloudTrail logging. The machine learning domain reputation model analyzes domain requests based on behavioral characteristics, such as popularity, history, and whether they are associated with known malicious or cryptocurrency related domains and IPs.
