AB  - This article presents an intelligent deployment solution for tabling that utilizes deep learning techniques. The solution involves adapting deep learning semantic segmentation algorithms with DeepLab V3+ to extract multi-dimensional image features, enabling the mapping of relationships between mineral ore belt characteristics and operating parameters using a multi-output support vector regression model optimized using a sparrow search algorithm (ssa-msvr). The proposed solution integrates image recognition software and data processing method, which significantly improves the efficiency and effectiveness of mineral processing, providing a promising avenue for further research and development in this field.
