AU  - S. Muktevi
AU  - Y. Nagpal
AU  - R. Leela
AU  - J. Muktevi
T2  - IEEE Data Descriptions
AB  - This article introduces the Synthetic Carbon Capture Storage Measurement Reporting and Verification dataset (SCCS-OFPOSDU), the first publicly available synthetic dataset designed to support carbon capture and storage (CCS) measurement, reporting, and verification (MRV) workflows. The dataset simulates the capture–transport–injection–storage–monitoring chain, providing daily, monthly, and annual records for synthetic facilities across multiple reservoir types. It is explicitly mapped to the Open Footprint (OFP) emissions model and Open Subsurface Data Universe (OSDU) schemas, enabling standards-based interoperability and environmental, social, and governance (ESG) reporting validation. All records are generated using reproducible, open-source Python workflows, with quality checks for mass balance, reservoir-recycling rules, and leak event logic. The dataset facilitates CCS MRV system prototyping, schema alignment testing, teaching, and benchmarking. IEEE SOCIETY/COUNCIL Power and Energy Society (PES) DATA TYPE/LOCATION Synthetic, CCS MRV Time-Series + Rollups; Zenodo Repository DATA DOI/PID https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17576989
